.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.sp -1
.IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
geoclue_accuracy_level=4
.sp
Set the integer value for the accuracy level request to the GeoClue service\&. Values to match the
\m[blue]\fBGClueAccuracyLevel\fR\m[]\&\s-2\u[13]\d\s+2:
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
