\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.sp -1
.IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
gpx_tidy_points=true
.sp
ATM Only attempts to remove a suspicious first point of a GPX track (as opposed to any points within a track)\&.
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
