.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.sp -1
.IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
layers_create_trw_auto_default=false
.sp
Create new TrackWaypoint layers without showing the layer properties dialog first\&.
.RE
