.\}
osm_basic_auth=false
.sp
Set to true to force the use of HTTP Basic Authentication even when OAuth is available
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.sp -1
.IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
background_max_threads=10
.RE
.sp
